    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 18 is a spacious and bright one bedroom unit featuring a large balcony with views towards Dun Loaghaire. This apartment has been finished to an exceptional standard. The accommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway, open plan kitchen/living/dining room with floor to ceiling glazing and access to a east facing terrace, one double bedrooms with built in wardrobes, and large family bathroom.\r\n\r\nRockpoint by Moran Living, Blackrock Village represents a best in class development, comprising of 91 residential units situated in a long established and desirable residential area overlooking Dublin Bay. The development comprises of one, two and three bedroom apartments that are designed and styled to the very highest of standards with A rated BERs. Rockpoint offers an exceptional living experience. Tenants of the this newly built development benefit from on-site maintenance and management services, landscaped outdoor communal areas and stunning sea views. The interiors are spacious, and light filled spread across two separate blocks ranging from ground to fifth floor.\r\n\r\nFor further information please visit: rockpointblackrock.com\r\n\r\nThe apartments are now available for immediate occupation and get in touch to arrange an appointment!\r\n\r\nMore about the location…\r\n\r\nLocated south-east of Dublin City, Rockpoint is situated in the affluent south Dublin village of Blackrock, a highly sought after residential area. The development benefits from close proximity to a number of easily accessible employment hubs and recreational amenities. Seapoint Dart Station is located less than a 5 minute walk from the property providing easy access into Dublin City Centre within 15 minutes, while a quality bus corridor is located on Rockpoint's doorstep. Additionally there are superb local shopping and leisure amenities in the nearby surrounding area, with newly refurbished Frascati Shopping Centre and Blackrock Centre including retailers such as the Marks & Spencer, Aldi & SuperValu located only a 5 minute walk away. Blackrock Park, Seapoint Beach and numerous sports facilities and leisure facilities are also within walking distance of Rockpoint."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Experience Rockpoint by Moran Living.\r\nLocated in the heart of Blackrock Village.\r\nAvailable for immediate occupation.\r\nSecond Floor setting.\r\nLarge, east facing balcony.\r\nA-rated development.\r\nOn-site concierge manager.\r\nDART and bus services within a 5 minute walk away.\r\nHigh quality fittings.\r\nStylish bathroom.\r\nParking available at additional cost."
      },
